итый барьер заменяется новым до тех пор, пока не израсходуются защитные эффекты способности. Урон, превышающий здоровье барьера, поглощается полностью.","desc_en":"Templar Assassin becomes highly elusive, gaining a small barrier and bonus to her damage. The damage and avoidance effects are separate, and have a limited number of instances. If a barrier is consumed, a new one is created as long as there are charges left. If an instance of damage would deal more damage than the remaining barrier, all of the damage is absorbed.","notes_ru":["Урон, отнимающий здоровье, проходит через защиту и не уменьшает число эффектов способности."],"notes_en":["Damage as HP Removal bypasses Refraction (it won't reduce the charges)."],"specials":[{"key":"instances","system":false,"heading_ru":"ЧИСЛО ЭФФЕКТОВ:","heading_en":"INSTANCES:","values":[3.0,4.0,5.0,6.0],"percent":false,"talents":[{"talent":"special_bonus_unique_templar_assassin","level":25,"op":"add","value":4,"values_with":[7.0,8.0,9.0,10.0]}]},{"key":"shield_per_instance","system":false,"heading_ru":"ЗДОРОВЬЕ БАРЬЕРА ЗА ЭФФЕКТ:","heading_en":"BARRIER PER INSTANCE:","values":[30.0],"percent":false},{"key":"bonus_damage","system":false,"heading_ru":"ДОПОЛНИТЕЛЬНЫЙ УРОН:","heading_en":"BONUS DAMAGE:","values":[15.0,30.0,45.0,60.0],"percent":false,"values_shard":[30.0]},{"key":"bonus_damage_per_instance_burn","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[0.0],"percent":false,"legacy_facet":{"facet":"templar_assassin_refractor","values":[1.0],"op":0}},{"key":"duration","system":false,"heading_ru":"ДЛИТЕЛЬНОСТЬ:","heading_en":"DURATION:","values":[17.0],"percent":false},{"key":"cast_while_disabled","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[0.0],"percent":false,"values_shard":[1.0]},{"key":"dispels","system":false,"heading_ru":null,"heading_en":null,"values":[],"percent":false,"talents":[{"talent":"special_bonus_unique_templar_assassin_4","level":20,"op":"add","value":1}]},{"key":"AbilityManaCost",